{"type":"standard","title":"Mark Lamb (sheriff)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Mark Lamb (sheriff)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q96460391","titles":{"canonical":"Mark_Lamb_(sheriff)","normalized":"Mark Lamb (sheriff)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Mark Lamb (sheriff)</span></span>"},"pageid":64319806,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Mark_Lamb_%2855021585032%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Mark_Lamb_%2855021585032%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":408},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/Mark_Lamb_%2855021585032%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":2138,"height":2645},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1376930090","tid":"72005e54-ba12-11f1-9c92-722deab918c5","timestamp":"2026-09-27T01:26:21Z","description":"American sheriff (born 1972)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Lamb_(sheriff)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Lamb_(sheriff)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Lamb_(sheriff)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Mark_Lamb_(sheriff)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Lamb_(sheriff)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Mark_Lamb_(sheriff)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Lamb_(sheriff)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Mark_Lamb_(sheriff)"}},"extract":"Mark Lamb is an American law enforcement officer and politician who served as sheriff of Pinal County, Arizona, from January 1, 2017 until December 31, 2024. He is a member of the Republican Party. Lamb previously served in the Salt River Pima–Maricopa Indian Community police department. He is a member of the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints.","extract_html":"<p><b>Mark Lamb</b> is an American law enforcement officer and politician who served as sheriff of Pinal County, Arizona, from January 1, 2017 until December 31, 2024. He is a member of the Republican Party. Lamb previously served in the Salt River Pima–Maricopa Indian Community police department. He is a member of the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints.</p>"}